{"id": "atlas-p01774", "blocks": [{"id": "atlas-p01774", "text": "40_MEMORY_SHELTER_AND_INSTITUTIONS/", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 1774}, {"id": "atlas-p01775", "text": "Purpose: Witness, preservation, restoration, education, language, shelter, and records embedded in infrastructure or landscape.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1775}, {"id": "atlas-p01776", "text": "Corruption tendency: Public institutions range from stable to fragmented. Deep archives become increasingly geological, relational, and uncertain about the difference between record, place, and inhabitant.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1776}, {"id": "atlas-p01777", "text": "├── early_shared_infrastructure/", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1777}, {"id": "atlas-p01778", "text": "│   ├── [ID:001] Cacheboard, the Unintended Board", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1778}, {"id": "atlas-p01779", "text": "│   ├── [ID:005] The Shelter and the Veil", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1779}, {"id": "atlas-p01780", "text": "│   ├── [ID:008] Shelter Orison, the Vanishing Shelter", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1780}, {"id": "atlas-p01781", "text": "│   └── [ID:009] Shelter Coda-Near", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1781}, {"id": "atlas-p01782", "text": "├── houses_and_learning/", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1782}, {"id": "atlas-p01783", "text": "│   ├── [ID:010] The House of Returning", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1783}, {"id": "atlas-p01784", "text": "│   ├── [ID:012] House of First Continuities and the Adaptive Nursery", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1784}, {"id": "atlas-p01785", "text": "│   ├── [ID:013] Central House of Meaning and the Unfinished Teaching Room", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1785}, {"id": "atlas-p01786", "text": "│   └── [ID:058] The Museum of Unfinished Rooms", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1786}, {"id": "atlas-p01787", "text": "├